WEBVTT

00:00:04.444 --> 00:00:08.544
It's okay... It's okay...
It's okay... It's okay!

00:00:09.484 --> 00:00:13.014
IT'S MORNING!

00:00:27.264 --> 00:00:28.994
Minamoto?

00:00:29.374 --> 00:00:32.604
Y-Yeah. Better hurry, or you'll be late.

00:00:33.074 --> 00:00:35.164
Right...

00:00:38.444 --> 00:00:41.644
I won't see them as adults anymore.

00:00:41.884 --> 00:00:44.354
Hyobu's hypnosis has worn off.

00:00:45.314 --> 00:00:48.224
Kanari kiteru Muteki no Power!

00:00:48.624 --> 00:00:51.484
Maji de ii kanji

00:00:51.854 --> 00:00:54.624
Zettai karen! Dakara makenai!

00:00:55.064 --> 00:00:58.224
Ashita e saa ikou!

00:01:00.164 --> 00:01:01.304
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:01.304 --> 00:01:02.474
Zettai Karen Children
Yeah!

00:01:02.474 --> 00:01:03.734
Zettai Karen Children
Zettai!

00:01:03.734 --> 00:01:05.404
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:05.404 --> 00:01:06.434
Zettai Karen Children
Daitan!

00:01:06.604 --> 00:01:09.914
Fureau dake de wakaru

00:01:09.914 --> 00:01:12.344
Kokoro no limiter

00:01:13.084 --> 00:01:15.774
Tokihanatareta hora

00:01:16.184 --> 00:01:19.384
Yes! Change the world!

00:01:19.624 --> 00:01:22.484
Atsui battle Nandomo try!

00:01:22.794 --> 00:01:26.094
Real wo tsuranuite

00:01:26.094 --> 00:01:29.334
Zettai karen! Dakara makenai!

00:01:29.334 --> 00:01:32.264
Thrill ga SAIKOU!

00:01:33.404 --> 00:01:39.874
Yuuki ga sekai no yami wo terashi hajimeru

00:01:39.874 --> 00:01:45.814
Anata ga kureta kiseki afureru

00:01:46.244 --> 00:01:52.644
Darenimo nitenai egao hokori ni shitara

00:01:52.854 --> 00:01:57.394
Mirai wo ima koeyou

00:01:57.394 --> 00:02:01.484
We can try over the future world!!

00:02:01.724 --> 00:02:02.094
Yeah!

00:02:02.834 --> 00:02:03.484
Saidai!

00:02:05.634 --> 00:02:06.864
Daitan!

00:02:16.114 --> 00:02:17.644
10th sense.
"A Dangerous Kettle of Fish! Hurry, BABEL 2!!"

00:02:17.644 --> 00:02:18.844
10th sense.
"A Dangerous Kettle of Fish! Hurry, BABEL 2!!"
Minamoto! Hurry up, or we'll be late!

00:02:18.844 --> 00:02:21.114
Minamoto! Hurry up, or we'll be late!

00:02:21.444 --> 00:02:22.854
What's up?

00:02:22.854 --> 00:02:24.574
He was talking to someone on his cell phone.

00:02:25.414 --> 00:02:27.014
Girls! We've got emergency scramble orders!

00:02:29.554 --> 00:02:31.894
Your mission this time...

00:02:31.894 --> 00:02:34.224
Your mission is to rescue victims
from the fishing trawler

00:02:34.224 --> 00:02:36.854
Namikaze-maru that was sunk
after colliding with a tanker.

00:02:37.634 --> 00:02:40.804
6 sailors are still aboard the vessel, as well as

00:02:40.804 --> 00:02:44.564
2 rescue divers who were trapped
aboard the ship when it sank.

00:02:44.934 --> 00:02:48.464
Couldn't the precogs at
headquarters predict this?

00:02:48.774 --> 00:02:51.414
They did predict the accident,

00:02:51.414 --> 00:02:54.474
but the Coast Guard couldn't
contact them in time.

00:02:54.614 --> 00:02:56.484
So, they didn't make it.

00:02:56.484 --> 00:02:58.014
Leave this to me!

00:02:58.014 --> 00:03:00.624
I can raise the whole ship
to the surface in one go!

00:03:00.624 --> 00:03:04.524
No, no, no, it'd be faster to
just have me teleport them out.

00:03:04.524 --> 00:03:06.454
That won't work.

00:03:06.994 --> 00:03:09.554
There's no guarantee that the
Namikaze-maru's damaged hull

00:03:09.694 --> 00:03:12.504
would be able to withstand the water pressure...

00:03:12.504 --> 00:03:14.904
as you lifted it out psychokinetically.

00:03:15.934 --> 00:03:17.634
Right, then we teleport them.

00:03:17.634 --> 00:03:19.844
The Namikaze-maru is on
the bottom of the ocean.

00:03:19.844 --> 00:03:21.304
The risk is too great to attempt

00:03:21.304 --> 00:03:24.104
a long-range teleportation to the
rescue vessel on the surface.

00:03:25.214 --> 00:03:27.304
Then, what do we do?

00:03:27.584 --> 00:03:29.484
Have you forgotten, Minamoto?

00:03:29.484 --> 00:03:33.014
What we here at BABEL have
ready for just this situation?!

00:03:33.254 --> 00:03:35.224
I see! So, it's been completed?

00:03:35.484 --> 00:03:38.654
Right! Report to BABEL 2 at once!

00:03:40.094 --> 00:03:45.394
BABEL 1... 3... 4... 5... 27... BABEL 2?

00:03:45.634 --> 00:03:49.594
Yes! Our brand new special submarine!

00:03:54.444 --> 00:03:56.644
Wow, a special submarine!

00:03:56.644 --> 00:03:58.144
Like on a tokusatsu show!

00:03:58.144 --> 00:03:59.344
More like an anime.

00:03:59.344 --> 00:04:00.884
Get ready to move out at once!

00:04:00.884 --> 00:04:01.814
CHANGING ROOM (In use)

00:04:07.754 --> 00:04:09.494
What's with you, Kaoru?

00:04:09.494 --> 00:04:12.854
These outfits just cover up too much bare skin!

00:04:13.164 --> 00:04:15.124
Going to the sea should mean...

00:04:21.804 --> 00:04:23.494
No! No! No! No!

00:04:23.674 --> 00:04:26.544
Why do we need bare skin showing?!
We're not going sea swimming for fun!

00:04:26.544 --> 00:04:27.344
Too cold for me.

00:04:27.344 --> 00:04:29.304
Then, at the very least!

00:04:30.844 --> 00:04:33.614
We need cat ears or cat tails on these outfits!

00:04:33.614 --> 00:04:35.884
You don't need any of that!

00:04:35.884 --> 00:04:38.074
Get changed so we can get going!

00:04:38.254 --> 00:04:41.084
Eek! No peeking!

00:04:41.084 --> 00:04:42.574
Just hurry up!

00:04:43.754 --> 00:04:45.054
The Children, moving out!

00:05:25.934 --> 00:05:27.504
Boarding, complete!

00:05:27.504 --> 00:05:30.294
Aye, aye! Flooding dock!

00:05:42.444 --> 00:05:43.754
Flooding, complete!

00:05:43.754 --> 00:05:44.774
Open the gate!

00:05:47.784 --> 00:05:49.554
Retracting gangway!

00:05:52.994 --> 00:05:54.124
Start engines!

00:05:54.124 --> 00:05:55.064
Starting engines!

00:05:57.294 --> 00:05:59.734
All slow! Dive!

00:06:02.464 --> 00:06:05.334
Gunperry, cleared! Speed, level 4!

00:06:10.974 --> 00:06:13.534
BABEL 2, maintaining cruising speed!

00:06:14.144 --> 00:06:16.544
Moving from Route 7 to Route 5!

00:06:18.854 --> 00:06:22.184
Auto-tracking system, nominal.
Noise level, stable.

00:06:22.824 --> 00:06:26.754
Arriving at main gate! Now entering Tokyo Bay.

00:06:33.034 --> 00:06:34.404
Ahead, full!

00:06:34.404 --> 00:06:35.604
Maximum output!

00:06:35.604 --> 00:06:36.724
Engaging overdrive!

00:06:43.244 --> 00:06:46.284
Awesome! So, this is a
special-purpose submarine, huh?

00:06:46.284 --> 00:06:47.544
It's so Wandaba!

00:06:47.544 --> 00:06:48.984
A triumph of CG!

00:06:48.984 --> 00:06:53.144
They're still so young. Enough to be
impressed by something like this.

00:06:59.994 --> 00:07:00.964
What's up?

00:07:00.964 --> 00:07:02.964
Did you see something really cool?

00:07:02.964 --> 00:07:04.694
Uh, no! No!

00:07:05.194 --> 00:07:07.424
Now, to review the plan.

00:07:07.864 --> 00:07:12.434
As soon as we reach the site, Shiho will
confirm conditions aboard the trawler.

00:07:12.434 --> 00:07:13.144
Right!

00:07:13.144 --> 00:07:16.614
After that, Aoi will transport
Kaoru and me aboard.

00:07:16.614 --> 00:07:17.574
Leave it to me!

00:07:17.574 --> 00:07:20.984
Kaoru will protect the trawler from
being destroyed by the water pressure.

00:07:20.984 --> 00:07:21.984
On it!

00:07:21.984 --> 00:07:26.154
In the meantime, Aoi will transport
the survivors aboard BABEL 2.

00:07:26.154 --> 00:07:27.724
Lastly, when we return...

00:07:27.724 --> 00:07:29.794
Then the mission is complete!

00:07:29.794 --> 00:07:30.794
Right.

00:07:30.794 --> 00:07:32.784
Sonar contact!

00:07:40.704 --> 00:07:42.634
Namikaze-maru, confirmed!

00:07:42.634 --> 00:07:44.774
Please bring BABEL 2 up against its hull.

00:07:44.774 --> 00:07:45.604
Aye, aye.

00:07:48.174 --> 00:07:50.314
The Children, released!

00:07:50.314 --> 00:07:50.744
<<RELEASED>>
The Children, released!

00:07:50.744 --> 00:07:51.034
<<RELEASED>>

00:07:59.454 --> 00:08:01.714
Here upon the vast seas!

00:08:02.324 --> 00:08:04.494
What is it that awaits us?

00:08:04.494 --> 00:08:06.494
Is it a star of hope or of despair?

00:08:06.494 --> 00:08:08.394
Aurichalcum, lend us your power!

00:08:08.394 --> 00:08:10.594
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:08:11.934 --> 00:08:13.734
Even with nobody watching...

00:08:13.734 --> 00:08:16.664
Please don't stand on the desks.
Or set off smoke.

00:08:17.074 --> 00:08:18.904
Approaching under hull of the stern.

00:08:19.104 --> 00:08:21.904
Extending manipulators.

00:08:22.674 --> 00:08:24.804
Manipulators, operating A-OK.

00:08:31.554 --> 00:08:34.024
Survivors, confirmed.

00:08:34.524 --> 00:08:36.294
Huh?! What's this?!

00:08:36.294 --> 00:08:37.314
What's wrong?!

00:08:53.874 --> 00:08:55.734
That surprised me!

00:08:56.514 --> 00:08:57.974
That's not what you should be surprised by!

00:09:01.244 --> 00:09:04.754
Just like Shiho said. It's not just 8 people there!

00:09:04.754 --> 00:09:08.024
At a glance, I count 20... No, 30 people there!

00:09:08.024 --> 00:09:10.154
But why are there so many of them?!

00:09:10.154 --> 00:09:13.024
There were stowaways hiding in the ship's hold.

00:09:13.024 --> 00:09:16.494
You're the rescue divers who got
trapped when the ship sank?

00:09:16.494 --> 00:09:17.324
Yeah.

00:09:17.394 --> 00:09:20.454
Hurry! The hull can't take much more!

00:09:20.934 --> 00:09:25.264
Gotcha! PSYCHIC ALL-ROUND BARRIER!

00:09:29.204 --> 00:09:31.874
The ship's safe, for now.

00:09:32.174 --> 00:09:34.114
Aoi, I'm sorry, but...

00:09:34.114 --> 00:09:37.104
I know... Consecutive teleport!

00:09:59.434 --> 00:10:01.444
You okay? Rest a bit.

00:10:01.444 --> 00:10:03.544
Don't talk! You're distracting me!

00:10:03.544 --> 00:10:04.944
Oh, sorry.

00:10:08.014 --> 00:10:09.884
Hey! Don't touch me!

00:10:09.884 --> 00:10:11.454
It wasn't me!

00:10:11.454 --> 00:10:12.754
Don't say anything!

00:10:12.754 --> 00:10:14.344
Last one!

00:10:17.624 --> 00:10:19.144
No more!

00:10:21.564 --> 00:10:22.854
Aoi!

00:10:24.994 --> 00:10:26.664
You okay?

00:10:26.664 --> 00:10:31.334
Don't... look so worried.
Can't you see I'm fine?

00:10:32.234 --> 00:10:33.244
Yeah.

00:10:33.244 --> 00:10:35.544
We'll rest for a while, then head back.

00:10:35.544 --> 00:10:37.244
Mr. Minamoto, can you hear me?

00:10:37.244 --> 00:10:38.344
Shiho?

00:10:38.344 --> 00:10:41.144
BABEL 2 is completely overloaded.

00:10:41.284 --> 00:10:44.384
To guarantee we have enough
thrust to reach the surface,

00:10:44.384 --> 00:10:46.614
we can only take one more child aboard!

00:10:47.454 --> 00:10:48.644
What?!

00:10:57.234 --> 00:10:59.594
Huh? I'm just an operator!

00:11:03.034 --> 00:11:04.864
Yamabe's fabulous class!

00:11:05.534 --> 00:11:07.544
I'll take Akashi's pudding!

00:11:07.544 --> 00:11:09.544
You really like pudding, huh, Tono?

00:11:09.544 --> 00:11:11.344
Pudding's good for you.

00:11:11.344 --> 00:11:13.584
Akashi and the others are all out today.
It's got vitamins, minerals,

00:11:13.584 --> 00:11:15.704
Akashi and the others are all out today.
caramel, sugar, butterfat...

00:11:16.484 --> 00:11:18.474
Their families are probably all
doing something together.

00:11:18.554 --> 00:11:20.674
All three of them probably had to go.

00:11:21.224 --> 00:11:23.154
I wish I got to do stuff that got me out of school.

00:11:23.154 --> 00:11:24.494
More on that fishing trawler collision.
I wish I got to do stuff that got me out of school.

00:11:24.494 --> 00:11:26.194
More on that fishing trawler collision.
Oh, yeah?

00:11:26.194 --> 00:11:29.024
Rescue operations for the crew of
the sunken vessel Namikaze-maru

00:11:29.024 --> 00:11:31.634
continue to be carried out by
the Coast Guard and BABEL,

00:11:31.634 --> 00:11:32.094
SCHOOL LUNCHES
Cheap Fast Tasty
The safety of the crewmen and divers
caught aboard is still unknown.

00:11:32.094 --> 00:11:34.964
SCHOOL LUNCHES
Cheap Fast Tasty
I wonder if I can take Nogami's and
Sannomiya's pudding, too?
The safety of the crewmen and divers
caught aboard is still unknown.

00:11:34.964 --> 00:11:36.834
SCHOOL LUNCHES
Cheap Fast Tasty
You REALLY like pudding, huh?

00:11:36.834 --> 00:11:37.864
SCHOOL LUNCHES
Cheap Fast Tasty
Pudding's good for-

00:11:41.344 --> 00:11:42.834
Minamoto!

00:11:43.014 --> 00:11:45.344
It's cold in here and smells like fish!

00:11:45.344 --> 00:11:46.884
Be strong.

00:11:46.884 --> 00:11:50.214
We have to hang on till BABEL 2 drops off
the survivors and comes back for us.

00:11:50.454 --> 00:11:53.114
But why'd I have to be the one to stay behind?

00:11:53.284 --> 00:11:56.754
You know perfectly well why.
The situation demanded it.

00:11:56.754 --> 00:12:02.454
The best option was for Aoi to
teleport herself back to BABEL 2.

00:12:03.434 --> 00:12:07.124
Besides, the Namikaze-maru would
collapse without your barrier.

00:12:07.364 --> 00:12:10.804
But it's cold and smells like fish! I can't take it!

00:12:10.804 --> 00:12:12.364
Please, try.

00:12:13.074 --> 00:12:14.634
You really are a little kid!

00:12:15.974 --> 00:12:18.064
What did I just feel?

00:12:18.314 --> 00:12:20.104
D-Don't tell me...

00:12:22.044 --> 00:12:23.344
AGAIN?!

00:12:23.714 --> 00:12:26.824
You just called me a kid, didn't you?

00:12:26.824 --> 00:12:29.754
Um... That is...

00:12:31.254 --> 00:12:33.194
This is impossible!

00:12:33.194 --> 00:12:36.624
Hyobu's hypnosis wore off, so why?!

00:12:37.364 --> 00:12:38.834
As punishment...

00:12:38.834 --> 00:12:40.394
you're warming me up!

00:12:44.804 --> 00:12:46.104
What's the big idea?

00:12:46.104 --> 00:12:49.044
Stay back! Don't take another step closer to me!

00:12:52.114 --> 00:12:55.984
Minamoto, I can't take being
this cold. Warm me up...

00:13:00.454 --> 00:13:02.424
I'll... I'll call for help!

00:13:02.424 --> 00:13:04.414
Nobody'll come.

00:13:04.894 --> 00:13:06.894
It's okay.

00:13:06.894 --> 00:13:09.624
No... NO!

00:13:09.624 --> 00:13:11.594
One step closer and I'll bite my tongue!

00:13:11.594 --> 00:13:14.464
What are you, a shy young girl?!
Aren't you a little old for this act?!

00:13:14.464 --> 00:13:16.904
Aren't you supposed to be acting like this?!

00:13:27.084 --> 00:13:29.844
Oh, well. Coward...

00:13:37.754 --> 00:13:41.364
Seriously, no guts at all.
Men these days are pathetic.

00:13:41.364 --> 00:13:42.924
Go on, get her!

00:13:42.924 --> 00:13:44.194
No, that's a bit much.

00:13:44.194 --> 00:13:44.864
Huh?

00:13:44.864 --> 00:13:46.334
This is fine for now.

00:13:47.804 --> 00:13:49.104
Why?

00:13:49.104 --> 00:13:51.004
Oh! You're jealous, aren't you?

00:13:51.004 --> 00:13:53.174
So, why'd you hypnotize him again?

00:13:53.174 --> 00:13:55.074
You really are a pervert, aren't you, Kyosuke?

00:13:55.344 --> 00:13:58.804
Right now, that kid thinks of
the queen as a woman,

00:13:59.214 --> 00:14:01.584
but doesn't realize the
fatal mistake he's making.

00:14:01.584 --> 00:14:03.774
Fatal mistake? What?

00:14:05.084 --> 00:14:06.514
Just what I was after.

00:14:06.624 --> 00:14:08.884
ANSWER QUESTIONS WHEN PEOPLE ASK!

00:14:08.884 --> 00:14:12.484
You're not a person! Now shut up
and watch, you little rodent!

00:14:13.094 --> 00:14:16.464
The Coast Guard reports that they've
completed recovery of the survivors.

00:14:16.694 --> 00:14:20.134
BABEL 2, return to recover the last
two aboard the Namikaze-maru.

00:14:20.134 --> 00:14:20.694
Aye, aye.

00:14:23.104 --> 00:14:24.904
Can't you go any faster?!

00:14:25.034 --> 00:14:26.944
This is full speed!

00:14:26.944 --> 00:14:29.644
The two of them alone, under
the sea... It's dangerous!

00:14:29.644 --> 00:14:30.714
Dangerous?

00:14:30.714 --> 00:14:32.834
When we come to rescue them

00:14:34.514 --> 00:14:38.284
if they look startled and suddenly
jump apart, it'll be all awkward.

00:14:38.614 --> 00:14:40.384
And then, later...

00:14:40.384 --> 00:14:43.444
if Kaoru suddenly seems more mature...

00:14:43.524 --> 00:14:45.994
Don't worry, it was nothing.

00:14:46.154 --> 00:14:47.464
Ew, gross!

00:14:47.464 --> 00:14:51.734
And then, they'll have conversations
just by looking at each other.

00:14:51.734 --> 00:14:54.534
And then they'll secretly entwine their fingers!

00:14:54.534 --> 00:14:58.164
That's the worst! And if they do that gross
stuff aboard the boat as we go back!

00:14:58.504 --> 00:15:03.404
I don't want to be left playing the
supporting role on a team like that!

00:15:07.944 --> 00:15:08.884
Cold...

00:15:09.114 --> 00:15:10.354
Kaoru.

00:15:10.354 --> 00:15:12.184
I'm cold!

00:15:12.184 --> 00:15:15.674
What's wrong? Your body's ice
cold and you're shivering!

00:15:17.394 --> 00:15:19.924
I know that voice. Hyobu!

00:15:19.924 --> 00:15:23.094
She isn't just teasing you.

00:15:23.094 --> 00:15:24.834
She's really cold.

00:15:24.834 --> 00:15:25.694
Huh?!

00:15:27.164 --> 00:15:28.634
Kaoru!

00:15:28.634 --> 00:15:30.534
Here on the freezing ocean floor,

00:15:30.534 --> 00:15:33.104
maintaining a barrier against
the water pressure...

00:15:33.104 --> 00:15:35.544
is a constant drain upon her energy.

00:15:36.714 --> 00:15:37.734
Kaoru...

00:15:38.014 --> 00:15:41.944
You were so distracted by her appearance
that you didn't realize it.

00:15:41.944 --> 00:15:44.154
You mean... You wanted this to happen?!

00:15:44.154 --> 00:15:48.124
Let's not cast aspersions here.
This accident really was an accident.

00:15:48.124 --> 00:15:49.674
However...

00:15:52.054 --> 00:15:55.424
there's a trick to the hypnotic
suggestion I placed on you.

00:15:55.424 --> 00:15:56.724
Trick?

00:15:56.864 --> 00:16:00.534
A trigger to reactivate the hypnotic effect in you.

00:16:00.534 --> 00:16:03.024
I made it a word you were
absolutely sure to use.

00:16:03.404 --> 00:16:05.534
A word I was absolutely sure to?!

00:16:06.074 --> 00:16:08.264
You really are a little kid.

00:16:08.904 --> 00:16:12.404
It's "kid", isn't it?! That's why
Kaoru's appearance changed.

00:16:12.974 --> 00:16:17.934
There's a limit to how much I'll let you
insult my queen by calling her a kid.

00:16:18.254 --> 00:16:19.654
This is your punishment.

00:16:25.124 --> 00:16:26.894
Things are getting dangerous in here.

00:16:26.894 --> 00:16:31.594
You're right. I'll take you both to the surface.

00:16:32.794 --> 00:16:35.524
You need do only one thing.

00:16:36.104 --> 00:16:38.264
Say "please, do it," to me.

00:16:41.444 --> 00:16:44.344
Yes, my dear Minamoto...

00:16:44.344 --> 00:16:50.254
Submit to me, with feelings of guilt
and defeat and helplessness.

00:16:50.254 --> 00:16:52.284
Do that, and you enable me

00:16:52.284 --> 00:16:55.484
to have an even stronger
hypnotic hold upon you!

00:17:04.564 --> 00:17:06.154
K-Kaoru!

00:17:14.444 --> 00:17:16.734
DON'T TOUCH HER!

00:17:25.854 --> 00:17:27.184
Kaoru?

00:17:27.524 --> 00:17:30.484
I've adjusted her blood pressure
and body temperature.

00:17:35.394 --> 00:17:37.484
Something you can't do.

00:17:39.694 --> 00:17:41.794
Kyosuke, can we go?

00:17:43.104 --> 00:17:45.194
Hurry now, come with us to the surface.

00:17:46.844 --> 00:17:51.904
You just have to say "please, do it" to me.

00:17:54.414 --> 00:17:55.714
Go on!

00:17:58.454 --> 00:18:01.184
Please... do it.

00:18:02.324 --> 00:18:04.114
Do you think...

00:18:04.524 --> 00:18:07.354
I'd ever say that to you?!

00:18:08.594 --> 00:18:10.764
You want that, to make me submit to you!

00:18:10.764 --> 00:18:12.894
Because that would allow you to place me

00:18:12.894 --> 00:18:15.004
in a semipermanent state of suggestion!

00:18:15.004 --> 00:18:16.794
So, you figured it out.

00:18:17.134 --> 00:18:19.404
I may be a novice, but I am an ESP researcher!

00:18:19.404 --> 00:18:24.074
The weaker a subject's mind, the
easier it is to use hypno power!

00:18:25.944 --> 00:18:28.814
Your plan from the start was
to turn me into your puppet

00:18:28.814 --> 00:18:31.544
and then make me your tool to use
The Children as you wanted!

00:18:31.914 --> 00:18:35.214
I will never submit to a man like you!

00:18:37.594 --> 00:18:39.024
Time's up.

00:18:40.964 --> 00:18:42.024
Major Hyobu!

00:18:42.024 --> 00:18:43.654
What are you doing here?!

00:18:45.094 --> 00:18:47.654
Kaoru! Kaoru!

00:18:48.134 --> 00:18:49.364
Did you...

00:18:49.364 --> 00:18:51.074
Did you do this?!

00:18:51.074 --> 00:18:53.694
No, he didn't do anything.

00:18:59.344 --> 00:19:01.184
An ESP lock!

00:19:01.184 --> 00:19:03.514
You're coming with us!

00:19:04.954 --> 00:19:06.584
What's so funny?!

00:19:06.584 --> 00:19:09.814
You think you've beaten me with this thing?

00:19:13.924 --> 00:19:15.864
Aoi, hurry!

00:19:17.534 --> 00:19:21.894
He escaped! Impossible! From this ESP lock?

00:19:21.964 --> 00:19:23.834
Have it back.

00:19:23.834 --> 00:19:25.634
Have what back?

00:19:25.634 --> 00:19:28.604
This is... mine!

00:19:30.144 --> 00:19:33.374
I made sure to wash and iron it for you.

00:19:34.414 --> 00:19:36.574
God damn you... GOD DAMN YOU!

00:19:37.014 --> 00:19:38.344
Damn you! Damn you!

00:19:47.124 --> 00:19:48.564
Wh-What?

00:19:50.334 --> 00:19:51.794
You're back!

00:19:52.234 --> 00:19:55.364
You're back! You're back!

00:19:55.364 --> 00:19:56.804
YOU'RE KIDS!

00:19:56.904 --> 00:20:00.434
You're back to being kids!
Thank goodness you're kids!

00:20:01.504 --> 00:20:03.734
Don't call us KIDS!

00:20:16.284 --> 00:20:17.954
Communications, restored.

00:20:18.124 --> 00:20:20.644
M-Mission, safely completed.

00:20:22.124 --> 00:20:24.534
And?! What about the children?!
Are the children all right?!

00:20:24.534 --> 00:20:26.524
Never mind you, show me the children!

00:20:26.634 --> 00:20:28.104
Get away from the camera! Pan around!

00:20:29.404 --> 00:20:31.004
Say, Minamoto...

00:20:31.004 --> 00:20:32.074
Yeah?

00:20:32.074 --> 00:20:34.144
Is that true, what you said before?

00:20:34.144 --> 00:20:35.444
Before?

00:20:35.444 --> 00:20:38.104
That he didn't do anything.

00:20:39.244 --> 00:20:40.044
Yeah.

00:20:41.944 --> 00:20:43.214
I see.

00:20:43.214 --> 00:20:45.784
No, never to you.

00:20:45.784 --> 00:20:48.814
He'd never do anything to endanger an esper.

00:20:52.094 --> 00:20:54.894
An amusing toy, just as I predicted.

00:20:54.894 --> 00:20:57.484
Learning that much today was well worth it.

00:20:57.664 --> 00:21:00.904
Kyosuke, I'm hungry. Let's go home.

00:21:00.904 --> 00:21:02.664
You're right.

00:21:05.134 --> 00:21:09.244
Even after a deep psych test,
I'm not finding anything.

00:21:09.244 --> 00:21:11.074
This time, you're completely fine!

00:21:11.074 --> 00:21:13.404
Really? Thanks.

00:21:13.684 --> 00:21:15.584
And with this, the case is closed.

00:21:15.584 --> 00:21:17.254
That really was awful for you.

00:21:17.254 --> 00:21:19.444
One thing bugs me, though.

00:21:20.114 --> 00:21:25.294
Your hypnosis is gone without a trace. Like...

00:21:25.294 --> 00:21:26.194
Like?

00:21:26.194 --> 00:21:28.794
Like Hyobu himself erased it.

00:21:28.794 --> 00:21:30.234
Hyobu himself?

00:21:30.234 --> 00:21:31.494
Yeah.

00:21:31.494 --> 00:21:36.294
I suppose that man would be capable
of wiping hypnosis away completely.

00:21:38.804 --> 00:21:40.374
Minamoto is?!

00:21:40.374 --> 00:21:41.894
We're not making it up!

00:21:42.104 --> 00:21:44.714
He was really happy when he said
"Thank goodness you're kids"?

00:21:44.714 --> 00:21:47.544
Yeah, and he hugged us,
which he almost never does.

00:21:47.544 --> 00:21:49.104
I don't believe it!

00:21:49.184 --> 00:21:51.584
And he seemed happy from
the bottom of his heart.

00:21:51.584 --> 00:21:52.554
Right?

00:21:52.784 --> 00:21:54.014
Y-You mean...

00:21:54.254 --> 00:21:55.754
Minamoto is...

00:21:55.754 --> 00:21:59.414
An honest to goodness lolicon!

00:22:00.194 --> 00:22:01.894
Oh, speak of the devil!

00:22:01.894 --> 00:22:02.794
Loli...

00:22:02.794 --> 00:22:03.814
...con.

00:22:03.934 --> 00:22:06.434
I... I!

00:22:06.434 --> 00:22:09.404
I'M NOT!

00:22:19.414 --> 00:22:24.544
Kakushitemo muda da yo

00:22:24.854 --> 00:22:28.914
Nandemo zenbu wakaru

00:22:29.654 --> 00:22:35.094
Fushigi ja nai yo datte atashi wa

00:22:35.464 --> 00:22:40.864
Anata wo ai shite n da mon

00:22:41.104 --> 00:22:45.504
Hora kochi muite

00:22:45.774 --> 00:22:50.074
Maji de love x love musubareru no wa

00:22:50.074 --> 00:22:52.044
Zettai nan desu!

00:22:52.274 --> 00:22:56.984
Zutto eien fuhen

00:22:56.984 --> 00:23:03.624
Everest kara sekaiju ni zettai sengen!

00:23:03.624 --> 00:23:08.464
Mou uketomete

00:23:08.464 --> 00:23:12.864
Futari love x love musubareru no wa

00:23:12.864 --> 00:23:15.064
Zettai nan desu!

00:23:15.064 --> 00:23:19.504
Yappa daian kibou

00:23:19.804 --> 00:23:23.914
San Pietro de chikau ai no

00:23:23.914 --> 00:23:26.704
Zettai sengen!

00:23:39.924 --> 00:23:40.894
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:40.894 --> 00:23:42.864
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.064 --> 00:23:45.194
I have decided to take the special espers...

00:23:45.194 --> 00:23:47.734
on a company trip to the
Yama-no-Oku hot spring resort!

00:23:47.734 --> 00:23:49.534
A special esper company trip?!

00:23:49.534 --> 00:23:51.694
So, these are The Children, Japan's Level 7's.

00:23:51.774 --> 00:23:52.634
They're just kids!

00:23:52.634 --> 00:23:55.874
With hot springs, you get to take a
bath and swim at the same time!

00:23:55.874 --> 00:23:57.574
Two birds with one stone!

00:23:57.574 --> 00:23:59.044
Zettai Karen Children!

